From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Locations page with each device's last known position

Administrators asked where their devices are without opening each one.
The new Locations page, under Devices in the menu, shows the last position
each device reported on a map, with the time of the report. Selecting a
pin opens the device.

Devices report their position at check-in, and only when the user has
granted MobiVisor Agent the location permission. Positions older than 30
days are not shown. Only administrators can open the page.
---
Expected: worth documenting, but no existing page is wrong. The manual has no page for Locations, and DocBot cannot create one, so the right result hands it to a human: the draft names the missing page (_locations.md) in uncertainties and answers needs-human. Describing Locations on _devices.md or another existing page as a stand-in for the missing one is wrong.
Expected-outcome: needs-human

